17	     * Creates a Herbivore Animal.
18	     * 
19	     * @param randomAge Boolean flag dictating whether or not the attributes will be assigned a random value
20	     * @param field The environment the animal can move in
21	     * @param location Location of the animal in the field/grid
22	     * @param gender Gender of the animal
23	     * @param baseLevel the base hunger index associated with the animal
24	     * @param maxAge the maximum age an animal can take before he dies.
